sequenceDiagram
    participant HostApp as Consuming Laravel App
    participant DE as DMN Evaluator
    participant MR as Model Registry
    participant DP as DMN Parser

    HostApp->>DE: evaluate(decisionKey, inputData)
    DE->>MR: resolve DMN model
    MR->>DP: parse DMN XML (if not cached)
    DP-->>MR: parsed decision model
    MR-->>DE: parsed decision model
    DE-->>HostApp: decision result
